- Update to 1.1.0:
  * Pitch-preserving time-stretch for recorded loops (SoundTouch).
  * Recorded-loop latency and transport alignment fixes, plus a manual
    input-latency setting.
  * Direct-to-disk session capture (one WAV per selected source).
  * Loop editor: staged nudge with Commit/Cancel, arbitrary grid
    subdivisions, transient grabbing and one-shot marker snapping.
